OL,3,GNEWSATip reopens early as two more
OL,4,Aclose for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tip site in Leicestershire which was
OL,7,Fclosed for "essential improvement
OL,8,Fworks" has reopened a month ahead of
OL,9,Fschedule.
OL,11,FMountsorrel Recycling and Household
OL,12,FWaste Site was closed on 27 October to
OL,13,Fallow repairs to the concrete base in
OL,14,Fthe bottom yard to be carried out.
OL,16,FThe Granite Way site had been due to
OL,17,Fremain shut until early December, but
OL,18,Fon Saturday Leicestershire County
OL,19,FCouncil said the site had reopened
OL,20,Ffollowing the temporary closure.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
